{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2022-08-16 11:56:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ RESUMES TRADING IN VINCO VENTURES, INC.', 'text': "NEW YORK, AUG. 16, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE NASDAQ STOCK MARKET® (NASDAQ: NDAQ) ANNOUNCED THAT TRADING WILL RESUME TODAY IN VINCO VENTURES, INC. (NASDAQ: BBIG) AT 12:30 P.M. EASTERN TIME ON AUGUST 16, 2022. TRADING IN THE COMPANY'S STOCK WAS HALTED ON AUGUST 4, 2022 AT 1:44:39 P.M. EASTERN TIME."}